[[6759,2588,"The core donor data form could have contained more information as to the second lumbar test performed on the donor and could have given the results of the first lumbar puncture test","incomplete donor data form",""],[6760,2588,"There was information available on the medical microbiology report which was not passed on to the accepting transplant centre","untransmitted microbiology report",""],[6761,2588,"The Kidneys were accepted by the transplant centre following a telephone conversation between the consultant and the transplant coordinator","telephone acceptance without EOS system",""],[6762,2588,"The kidneys were accepted by the consultant acting alone","solo acceptance decision",""],[6763,2588,"The Coroner heard that a standard consent form is used for all operations, and heard evidence that this has proved unsatisfactory for transplant operations where issues have to be covered that are not catered for by the standard form","unsuitable standard consent form",""],[6855,2630,"The notification that should have been sent to the GP after the first admission to UHW on 29\" January 2015 was not sent","notification of admission to GPs not sent",""],[6856,2630,"electronic system of notification had been introduced in mid-2014","electronic notification system not utilised",""],[6857,2630,"EE informed me that he is now being put in charge of the notification system and that he intends to conduct an audit to ensure compliance","audit of notification system not adequately supported",""]]